(1) be an entity organized or existing under the laws of the United States, any state thereof or the District of Columbia,
(2) expressly assume all the obligations of the Borrower under this Agreement and the other Loan Documents to which the Borrower is a party
pursuant to a supplement hereto or thereto in form reasonably satisfactory to the Administrative Agent and the Borrower, and
